                                                                                                                <comments>
                            <comment id="16172666" author="klaster_1" created="Wed, 20 Sep 2017 03:16:20 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=kuaw26&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;kuaw26&quot;&gt;kuaw26&lt;/a&gt; please review.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Looks like there were several issues:&lt;br/&gt;
1. Permissions hook did not run at all. I&apos;ve updated it so it hooks into onBefore instead of onStart phase.&lt;br/&gt;
2. Permission hook returned `undefined`, but uiRouter hooks API &lt;a href=&quot;https://ui-router.github.io/ng1/docs/latest/modules/transition.html#hookresult&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;states&lt;/a&gt; that one of particular values should be returned in order to perform redirect. I&apos;ve fixed that.&lt;br/&gt;
3. Basic configuration screen lacked &quot;configuration&quot; permission. Even with fixes above it still stuck on loading screen. Fixed too.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16174104" author="kuaw26" created="Thu, 21 Sep 2017 01:38:36 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Please test several URLs in incognito mode.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16174145" author="pkonstantinov" created="Thu, 21 Sep 2017 02:36:16 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Successfully tested with several URLs in incognito mode. All times I was redirected to 403 page.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16174208" author="kuaw26" created="Thu, 21 Sep 2017 03:27:21 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Looks good. Merged to master. Please retest.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16174483" author="pkonstantinov" created="Thu, 21 Sep 2017 09:15:49 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Re-tested. Closed.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
